          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Harper",
            type: "Footpad_Peasant",
            side: 1,
            x: 7,
            y: 29,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Harper",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Harper",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Red",
            text: _("Look, goblin riders approach! You was right, they was going to raid Dallben while we was gone."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("We gots to stop them or they’ll burn down the whole village. Damn these goblins and damn the Crown. We always be havin’ to fight for ourselves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("Uncle, we got no time to talk! Them riders are heading full speed straight for Dallben. We’ll need to chase them down through those woods, and fast, or we won’t be able to catch up."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Do it. Hold them beasts back till us old-timers get there to finish ‘em off."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("And Harper... don’t be getting reckless on me today. Your old man died like that, charging into a pack of goblins by ‘imself. I won’t lose ya the same way."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("I know, I know, no need to worry so much. All right, let’s go!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("These orc raids keep getting harder and harder to hold off. Feels like every new day’s just another chance for us to lose everything..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("That Garard II stopped sendin’ patrols out here a while back. Stinker probably sent his troops on some new war against them orcs. Don’t really matter. Technically Annuvin be under the charge of Elensefar, but you don’t see ‘em coming to help us either."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("Then why do we got to pay taxes to the King? Maybe Elensefar doesn’t help us, but at least they don’t take our gold."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("We don’t got no choice, lass. If I don’t gives them what they want, they’ll make trouble for everyone in Dallben."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("But we can’t keep doing this forever, Uncle. If we stay like this, those orcs will eventually overrun us. What should we do?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("I don’t know, Harper. I just don’t know. Alls I can say is we’re on our own out here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
